fixture cam_teleport
doc BUILD.md s6 Ember Toss "Throw the ember as a 600 u/s projectile ... press again to teleport to it"; docs/adr/0011: after a teleport the camera glides to the player instead of cutting
room test/camera
spawn 2000 3200
frames 120
input
  # Straight ahead along the floor; the teleport at the end of the ember's 40-frame flight.
  0 R toss
  45 toss
end
expect
  at 0 event.toss=1
  # The ember flew 400 u from where Ash stood when it spawned (the R press moved Ash 1.5 u).
  at 45 event.teleport=1 x>2400u x<2402u
end
